  "about": "Scenarios for the Data class of app/vault/data.js — what an editor and an assistant do to pages — replayed by app/vault (scripts/export-conformance.mjs) and by any port. Ops name pages by path; `{{id:<path>}}` inside a patch or a new page is replaced by that page's id when the op runs; `as` labels a result for later ops, `baseFrom` puts a labelled page's {mtime, updated} into the patch as `base`. Patches are JSON TEXT, so their key order survives to both sides. After every op, every file — .history/ and .trash/ included — is recorded with the clock that wrote it. Invented content only.",
